---
import MemberLayout from "../../layouts/MemberLayout.astro";
const version = Date.now();

const frontmatter = {
  title:
    "Bonus Rewards for Active Members | Earn Bonus Credits | Wikimint Marketing Platform",
  description:
    "Receive bonus credits through eligible member activities on the Wikimint Marketing Platform. View available bonus rewards, claim eligible credits, and take part in additional reward opportunities designed for active members.",
  image: "/assets/images/others/bonus-rewards-wikimint-marketing-platform.webp",
  tags: ["about", "business", "finance"],
  author: "Wikimint Team",
  disableAds: true,
};
---

<MemberLayout frontmatter={frontmatter}>
  <div class="mo mb-10">
    <section
      id="daily-login"
      class="scroll-mt-24 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-0">Daily Login Bonus</h2>

      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 max-w-3xl">
        Claim a small bonus once every day simply by logging in. This reward
        encourages regular participation on the Wikimint platform. Eligibility
        is verified securely on the server before credits are awarded.
      </p>

      <button
        id="claim-daily-login"
        disabled
        class="btn disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed">
        Claim 0.002 Credits
      </button>

      <p id="daily-login-message" class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500"></p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <article class="prose lg:prose-xl max-w-none">
    <h1>Bonus Rewards for Active Members | Wikimint Marketing Platform</h1>

    <p>
      Bonus rewards are an additional way to receive credits while participating
      in the Wikimint Marketing Platform. They recognise regular account
      activity and encourage members to return, complete available reward
      opportunities, and remain involved with the platform.
    </p>

    <button class="w-full btn login go"> Promote Your Personal Brand </button>

    <img
      loading="lazy"
      src="/assets/images/others/bonus-rewards-wikimint-marketing-platform.webp"
      alt="Modern illustration representing bonus rewards, member achievements, credits, gift rewards, digital marketing, and account growth on the Wikimint Marketing Platform."
      title="Bonus Rewards for Active Members | Wikimint Marketing Platform"
      class="w-full"
    />

    <p>
      Whether you are a new member or have been using the platform for a long
      time, bonus rewards can gradually increase your available credits and
      support your overall marketing activities.
    </p>

    <h2>Receive Credits Through Bonus Reward Activities</h2>

    <p>
      Different bonus reward opportunities may become available throughout your
      membership. Each reward has its own eligibility requirements, frequency,
      and credit value.
    </p>

    <p>Examples may include:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Daily login rewards</li>
      <li>Promotional campaigns</li>
      <li>Seasonal events</li>
      <li>Community activities</li>
      <li>Special member rewards</li>
      <li>Future platform bonus programs</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Available rewards may change as new activities are introduced.</p>

    <h3>Check Available Rewards Regularly</h3>

    <p>
      Some rewards can only be claimed during a specific period. Visiting your
      Bonus Rewards page regularly helps you avoid missing reward opportunities
      that are currently available to your account.
    </p>

    <p>
      Even small bonus rewards can gradually increase your credit balance over
      time.
    </p>

    <h2>Every Eligible Reward Adds Value</h2>

    <p>
      Credits received through bonus rewards become part of your account balance
      according to the applicable platform rules.
    </p>

    <p>
      As your available credits increase, you become eligible for additional
      platform opportunities that depend on account participation and credit
      balance.
    </p>

    <p>
      Regular participation can produce steady progress without requiring
      additional investment.
    </p>

    <h2>Simple to Claim</h2>
    <h3>Complete Eligible Activities</h3>

    <p>
      Most bonus rewards require only a few simple actions before they become
      available.
    </p>

    <p>Depending on the reward, you may simply need to:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Log in to your account</li>
      <li>Complete an eligible activity</li>
      <li>Meet the published requirements</li>
      <li>Claim the available reward</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      The Bonus Rewards page displays the rewards currently available for your
      account.
    </p>

    <h2>Stay Active Throughout the Year</h2>

    <p>
      New reward opportunities may be introduced during special events or
      platform campaigns.
    </p>

    <p>
      Checking this page regularly allows you to participate whenever new
      rewards become available.
    </p>

    <p>
      Members who remain active often receive more opportunities than those who
      visit only occasionally.
    </p>

    <h2>Part of Your Marketing Journey</h2>

    <p>
      Bonus rewards are designed to encourage continued participation while
      giving members another way to build their available credits.
    </p>

    <p>
      Combined with other earning opportunities available within the Wikimint
      Marketing Platform, bonus rewards help create additional value for active
      members.
    </p>

    <p>
      Return to this page frequently, claim eligible rewards, and continue
      building your account through regular participation.
    </p>

    <section id="faq" class="hr bg-white">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <div class="acc space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-4" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
          <div class="acc-item">
            <input type="radio" name="acc" id="q1" checked />
            <div
              itemprop="mainEntity"
              itemscope
              itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
              <label for="q1" class="acc-title">
                <h3 itemprop="name" class="text-lg">
                  What are Bonus Rewards on the Wikimint Marketing Platform?
                </h3>
              </label>
              <div
                itemprop="acceptedAnswer"
                itemscope
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"
                class="acc-content">
                <p itemprop="text">
                  Bonus Rewards are additional credit opportunities offered to
                  eligible members who participate in supported platform
                  activities. They are separate from other earning methods and
                  are intended to encourage regular account activity. The
                  available rewards may change over time as new campaigns,
                  events, or member programs are introduced.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <input type="radio" name="acc" id="q2" />
            <div
              itemprop="mainEntity"
              itemscope
              itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
              <label for="q2" class="acc-title">
                <h3 itemprop="name" class="text-lg">
                  Who can receive Bonus Rewards?
                </h3>
              </label>
              <div
                itemprop="acceptedAnswer"
                itemscope
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"
                class="acc-content">
                <p itemprop="text">
                  Bonus Rewards are available to members who meet the
                  requirements for a particular reward. Some rewards may be
                  available to every member, while others may depend on account
                  status, completed activities, or special events. Reading the
                  reward details before claiming helps you understand the
                  eligibility requirements.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <input type="radio" name="acc" id="q3" />
            <div
              itemprop="mainEntity"
              itemscope
              itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
              <label for="q3" class="acc-title">
                <h3 itemprop="name" class="text-lg">
                  How often are new Bonus Rewards added?
                </h3>
              </label>
              <div
                itemprop="acceptedAnswer"
                itemscope
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"
                class="acc-content">
                <p itemprop="text">
                  New Bonus Rewards may appear at different times throughout the
                  year. Some rewards are available every day, while others are
                  introduced during promotional campaigns, member events, or
                  platform updates. Visiting the Bonus Rewards page regularly
                  helps you stay informed about the latest reward opportunities.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <input type="radio" name="acc" id="q4" />
            <div
              itemprop="mainEntity"
              itemscope
              itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
              <label for="q4" class="acc-title">
                <h3 itemprop="name" class="text-lg">
                  Can I claim the same Bonus Reward more than once?
                </h3>
              </label>
              <div
                itemprop="acceptedAnswer"
                itemscope
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"
                class="acc-content">
                <p itemprop="text">
                  This depends on the reward itself. Some rewards are available
                  only once, while others may be claimed daily, weekly, monthly,
                  or during recurring events. The Bonus Rewards page clearly
                  shows the availability and any applicable claim limits for
                  each reward offered to your account.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <input type="radio" name="acc" id="q5" />
            <div
              itemprop="mainEntity"
              itemscope
              itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
              <label for="q5" class="acc-title">
                <h3 itemprop="name" class="text-lg">
                  Do Bonus Rewards increase my available credits?
                </h3>
              </label>
              <div
                itemprop="acceptedAnswer"
                itemscope
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"
                class="acc-content">
                <p itemprop="text">
                  Yes. Eligible Bonus Rewards add credits to your account
                  according to the rules for each reward. Your available credits
                  can then become part of your overall participation within the
                  platform and may contribute to other member opportunities that
                  depend on your credit balance.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <input type="radio" name="acc" id="q6" />
            <div
              itemprop="mainEntity"
              itemscope
              itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
              <label for="q6" class="acc-title">
                <h3 itemprop="name" class="text-lg">
                  Will I lose Bonus Rewards if I do not claim them?
                </h3>
              </label>
              <div
                itemprop="acceptedAnswer"
                itemscope
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"
                class="acc-content">
                <p itemprop="text">
                  Some Bonus Rewards may have an expiration period or a limited
                  availability window. If a reward is not claimed before it
                  expires, it may no longer be available. Checking this page
                  frequently helps you avoid missing rewards that are currently
                  available to your account.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="acc-item">
          <input type="radio" name="acc" id="q7" />
          <label for="q7" class="acc-title">
            <h3 class="text-lg">
              Do I need to pay anything to receive Bonus Rewards?
            </h3>
          </label>
          <div class="acc-content">
            <p>
              No. Bonus Rewards are provided according to the eligibility rules
              published for each reward. If your account qualifies and the
              required activity has been completed, you can claim the reward
              without making an additional payment specifically for that reward
              opportunity.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="acc-item">
          <input type="radio" name="acc" id="q8" />
          <label for="q8" class="acc-title">
            <h3 class="text-lg">
              Why should I visit the Bonus Rewards page regularly?
            </h3>
          </label>
          <div class="acc-content">
            <p>
              The Bonus Rewards page is the central location for viewing current
              reward opportunities. Since available rewards may change from time
              to time, visiting the page regularly helps you identify newly
              added rewards, claim eligible credits, and remain informed about
              upcoming member activities.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="acc-item">
          <input type="radio" name="acc" id="q9" />
          <label for="q9" class="acc-title">
            <h3 class="text-lg">Can Bonus Rewards change in the future?</h3>
          </label>
          <div class="acc-content">
            <p>
              Yes. The types of Bonus Rewards, eligibility requirements, claim
              frequency, and reward values may be updated as the Wikimint
              Marketing Platform continues introducing new member programs and
              promotional activities. Any available rewards will always be shown
              on your Bonus Rewards page.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="acc-item">
          <input type="radio" name="acc" id="q10" />
          <label for="q10" class="acc-title">
            <h3 class="text-lg">
              How do Bonus Rewards support long-term participation?
            </h3>
          </label>
          <div class="acc-content">
            <p>
              Bonus Rewards provide another way for active members to receive
              credits while participating in the platform. Claiming available
              rewards regularly can gradually increase your credit balance,
              making your account more active and allowing you to take part in
              additional platform opportunities over time.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</MemberLayout>

<script
  is:inline
  type="module"
  src={`/assets/js/bonus-rewards.js?v=${version}`}
  defer></script>
